* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.exe binary

# Instrument data, kept byte for byte: these came off Tektronix disks or
# were written for an instrument to read, and text=auto would hand back
# a file whose bytes are not the ones that went in.
*.MSK binary
*.SET binary
*.wfm binary
*.isf binary
